/Title (This project analyzed customer characteristics and predicted churn using a tuned CatBoost model. Churn was highest among new customers on month-to-month contracts, and contract type and tenure were the strongest drivers. The model detected 72% of churners with 57% precision. Its predicted risk segments, from about 10% \(Low\) to about 70% \(High\) actual churn.)
